# Line-endings policy (M2-A/P1-4): what the friend gets after a clone is a
# property of the repo, not of each friend's core.autocrlf setting.
# !-start.bat's own comment: LF-only breaks cmd parsing -- pin it CRLF at
# checkout on EVERY clone (autocrlf=true or false, CI, scoop, portable git);
# sources stay LF everywhere (their blobs already are).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.py  text eol=lf
